	(text_box "These are the connections from the battery to the board. The battery comes with one connector with 3 cables. One for the battery voltage, one for the ground and one for the voltage of the included NTC in the battery. We use a MOLEX connector to bring the battery cables to the PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 32.0439 0)
		(size 46.99 16.2161)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
