			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5708d4ee-95b3-479c-a360-90bd8503f329")
	)
	(text_box "The BQ25886 is the charging IC chosen for this board. It handles the charging and the power managing of the battery. All the resistors and capacitors used follow the directions given in the IC's datasheet.\n"
